    "conteudo": "<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://wrxixyyppfddfxnsnwnt.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/article-images/articles/1d771e30-5755-4e90-8a63-87f33dd2315d/ga954367475c614a2951bcf1d4c6d565d4b364d3b4fb735f6e6fae405f0a36e72bc2c1ff0b97a500b5617b24d13e6e95d8a520dc25cd4cd9fd8ccd8cfdc337cb1_1280-8236497-682x1024.jpg\",\"id\":6879,\"alt\":\"laptop, business, office, desk, job, work, laptop, laptop, laptop, laptop, business, job, job, work, work, work, work, work\",\"dimRatio\":60,\"customOverlayColor\":\"#837b76\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":false,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"heading\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|theme-palette9\"}},\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|theme-palette9\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"theme-palette9\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-6879 size-large\" alt=\"laptop, business, office, desk, job, work, laptop, laptop, laptop, laptop, business, job, job, work, work, work, work, work\" src=\"https://wrxixyyppfddfxnsnwnt.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/article-images/articles/1d771e30-5755-4e90-8a63-87f33dd2315d/ga954367475c614a2951bcf1d4c6d565d4b364d3b4fb735f6e6fae405f0a36e72bc2c1ff0b97a500b5617b24d13e6e95d8a520dc25cd4cd9fd8ccd8cfdc337cb1_1280-8236497-682x1024.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#837b76\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|theme-palette8\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"theme-palette8\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-theme-palette-8-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size\">Crie gratuitamente, em poucos minutos, seu curriculum vitae profissional.</h2>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>Criamos essa ferramenta com o objetivo de auxiliar você na criação de seu curriculum vitae, um documento essencial para quem está a procura de um novo emprego.</p>\n\n<p>O currículo gerado segue as dicas e recomendações de vários profissionais da área de recrutamento e seleção de pessoas. Esperamos contribuir assim com sua inserção no mercado de trabalho.</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><p>Os dados fornecidos abiaxo não ficarão armazenados.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://recomecar360.org/gerar-curriculo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Clique aqui e gere seu currículo agora!</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<p></p>",
